        "@type": "EVORAO:RiskGroup",
        "dcterms:title": "No RG"
      },
      "EVORAO:productionSystem": "Human SARS-CoV-2 Spike specific single B-cells are FACS sorted. After amplification the variable regions are cloned into Heavy and Light pFUSEss plasmids. The antibody is brought to expression by co-transfecting 293T cells and subsequently affinity purified and concentrated.",
