      "dcterms:title": "SARS-CoV-2 clone, Wuhan with S-Gene of Omicron BA.1",
      "dcterms:description": "Virus was produced from plasmid-based DNA segments of a common Wuhan strain. The S-gene was site-specifically replaced with a cloned BA.1-based S-gene sequence. S carries these mutations: A67V; 69-70del; T95I; GVYY142-145D; NL211-212I; ins214EPE; G339D; S371L; S373P; S375F; K417N; N440K; G446S; S477N; T478K; E484A; Q493R; G496S; Q498R; N501Y; Y505H; T547K; D614G; H655Y; N679K; P681H; N764K; D796Y; N856K; Q954H; N969K; L981F",
