      "search:sku": "001B-04242",
      "search:title": " Positive control for encapsidated RNA extraction from swab, urine and stool samples, provided with primers and probe",
      "search:description": "Lyophilized encapsidated RNA (ArRNA) contains a region of the MS2 phage and is used as positive control for extraction and real time RT-PCR. The ArRNA is especially developed to be spiked in nasopharyngeal, salivary, urine and stool samples. \r\nProvided with Lyophilized ready-to-use primers and probe  for real time RT-PCR in a region of the MS2 phage.\r\nPositive control packaged for 100 Rxns; P&P packaged for 96 rxns in the form of 2x48 rxns\r\nDisclaimer: This product does not contain the polymerase.\r\nFor RUO (Research Use Only).",
      "search:taxonLabel": "Escherichia virus MS2, Viruses",
